# Ocelot Pride: "...for each token you control that entered this turn, create a token that's a copy of it." Bot1 controls two
# Ocelot Prides and, on turn 7, ten permanents (the city's blessing). Attacking with one Pride gains life, so both trigger
# at the beginning of the end step. The first makes a Cat and a copy of it (two Cats). The second makes a Cat and then, for
# each of the three tokens that entered this turn - two of them copies of a Cat - a copy of it: three more, six Cats in all.

